<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia TCV 2001 bond tender yields 7.2843.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia TCV 2001 bond tender yields 7.2843.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corp of Victoria (TCV) said on Monday its tender of its 12 percent September 2001 stock produced a weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.2843 percent.  </p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON    12 PCT     MATURITY  22.09.01</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	 7.2843     SETT DATE 01.05.97</p>
<p> ALLOTTED A$100 MLN    RANGE     7.28-7.29</p>
<p>TCV is the central borrowing authority for the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
